{
  "_comment": "Known mishearings of names, applied to every transcript after the speech-to-text pass (tools/lib/spellings.ts). Whole-word, case-insensitive, case-preserving unless noted. Only include spellings that are unambiguously a name — never ordinary words (so no Goofy/Potty/Smoky). Regex rules use $1 groups. Seeded from the 2026-09-12 character cleanup.",
